---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Founders & Leadership | Eventina Organisers"
  description="Meet the visionary founders of Eventina Organisers: Ashwini Digole and Aditya Bagade. Directing bespoke luxury celebrations, floral scenography, and turnkey event production across Pune and India's finest destinations."
  ogImage="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
>
  <!-- Interior Hero Banner -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="founders-hero-title">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumb-list">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li><a href="/about">About Us</a></li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li aria-current="page">Founders</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <span class="eyebrow">Leadership &amp; Creative Direction</span>
      <h1 id="founders-hero-title" class="page-hero-title">
        The Visionaries Behind Eventina
      </h1>
      <p class="page-hero-lead">
        Meet the minds uniting architectural spatial design, five-star luxury hospitality, and arena-grade technical production into every celebration.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founders Intro Narrative -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="founders-ethos-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="founders-lead-banner">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Leadership Philosophy</span>
        <h2 id="founders-ethos-heading" style="font-size: var(--text-3xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          Where Artistic Audacity Meets Flawless Execution
        </h2>
        <p>
          At Eventina, our founding partners don’t delegate creative vision to distant subcontractors. Each commission is directly stewarded by our directors, ensuring that every nuance of aesthetic curation, acoustic staging, and guest hospitality reflects your distinct standards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Founders Cards Grid -->
      <div class="founders-grid">
        <!-- Founder 1: Ashwini Digole -->
        <article class="founder-card">
          <div class="founder-photo-box">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=800&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
              alt="Ashwini Digole, Co-Founder and Creative Director of Eventina Organisers"
              width="800"
              height="1000"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="founder-photo-overlay">
              <span class="founder-role-badge">Co-Founder &amp; Creative Director</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-details">
            <h3 class="founder-name">Ashwini Digole</h3>
            <p class="founder-bio">
              Specializing in luxury event styling, spatial scenography, and bespoke celebration aesthetics, Ashwini breathes soul and elegance into every occasion. With an intuitive grasp of color palettes, floral architectures, and experiential ambiance, she turns personal narratives into unforgettable sensory journeys.
            </p>
            <blockquote class="founder-quote">
              &ldquo;A truly memorable celebration isn't just observed—it is felt. Every petal, candle flame, and drape should whisper romance, warmth, and timeless refinement.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>

            <div class="founder-expertise" aria-label="Key areas of expertise for Ashwini Digole">
              <span class="expertise-chip">Luxury Scenography</span>
              <span class="expertise-chip">Floral Architecture</span>
              <span class="expertise-chip">Bespoke Styling</span>
            </div>

            <div class="founder-social-links" aria-label="Social profiles for Ashwini Digole">
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ms.eventina?psln=MW15aTIxaGl0aWp4dw%3D%3D&utm_source=qr" class="founder-social-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Ashwini Digole on Instagram">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
                  <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
                  <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Founder 2: Aditya Bagade -->
        <article class="founder-card">
          <div class="founder-photo-box">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=800&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
              alt="Aditya Bagade, Co-Founder and Managing Director of Eventina Organisers"
              width="800"
              height="1000"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="founder-photo-overlay">
              <span class="founder-role-badge">Co-Founder &amp; Managing Director</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="founder-details">
            <h3 class="founder-name">Aditya Bagade</h3>
            <p class="founder-bio">
              Steering operations, production logistics, and technical execution, Aditya ensures that every grand vision unfolds with clockwork precision. From complex venue logistics across Pune and destinations throughout India to high-energy entertainment and seamless vendor synchrony, he commands the operational spine of every Eventina production.
            </p>
            <blockquote class="founder-quote">
              &ldquo;Precision behind the scenes is what unlocks effortless wonder on the stage. We orchestrate the complexity so you can cherish every precious moment.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>

            <div class="founder-expertise" aria-label="Key areas of expertise for Aditya Bagade">
              <span class="expertise-chip">Production Logistics</span>
              <span class="expertise-chip">Venue Management</span>
              <span class="expertise-chip">Turnkey Execution</span>
            </div>

            <div class="founder-social-links" aria-label="Social profiles for Aditya Bagade">
              <a href="https://www.instagram.com/mr.eventina?rpxt=MTVlZ3Vzc3dmcnY4OA==" class="founder-social-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Aditya Bagade on Instagram">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                  <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
                  <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
                  <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership Commitments Section -->
  <section class="section founder-ethos-section" aria-labelledby="ethos-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header text-center">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Guiding Creed</span>
        <h2 id="ethos-heading">The Eventina Leadership Commitments</h2>
        <p>Principles that govern every relationship, production decision, and celebration we direct.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ethos-grid">
        <div class="ethos-card">
          <h3>Direct Partner Stewardship</h3>
          <p>We take on a strictly limited number of commissions per calendar season. Ashwini or Aditya is physically present at every major walkthrough, rehearsal, and live production.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ethos-card">
          <h3>Discreet VIP Protection</h3>
          <p>From prominent business families to celebrity icons, privacy is sacrosanct. We maintain strict non-disclosure agreements, encrypted guest manifests, and perimeter access controls.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ethos-card">
          <h3>Zero Commission Bias</h3>
          <p>We recommend venues, florists, and artists based solely on aesthetic and operational excellence. Our vendor curation is transparent, unbiased, and aligned completely with your interests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Global CTA Band -->
  <section class="cta-band" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
    <div class="container cta-inner">
      <h2 id="cta-heading">Collaborate Directly with Our Founding Team</h2>
      <p>
        Schedule a private creative consultation to explore concepts, feasibility, and custom scenography for your upcoming celebration.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/enquiry" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          <span>Schedule Creative Consultation</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4 10H16M11 5L16 10L11 15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/about" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">
          <span>Explore Company Story</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
